6273668.220815709%2C-7165370.905776407%2C6274721.618611764&amp;dg=599%241%2C2254%240%240%2C2251%240%240%2C2245%240%240%2C2248%240%240%2C2257%240%240%2C2242%240%240%2C2205%240%240%2C1048%240%240%2C401%240%240%2C2384%241%240%2C337%241%240%2C960%241%240%2C980%240%240%2C1568%240%240%2C1567%240%240%2C588%240%240%2C550%240%240%2C562%240%240%2C313%240%240%2C194%240%240%2C868%240%240%2C1423%240%240%2C429%240%240%2C683%240%240%2C1474%240%240%2C1475%241%240%2C1551%240%240%2C1187%240%240%2C1185%240%240%2C1183%240%240%2C1186%240%240%2C1233%240%240%2C1100%240%240%2C1630%240%240%2C1629%240%240%2C1019%240%240%2C93%240%240%2C83%240%240%2C2093%240%240%2C56%240%2450%2C153%240%2455%2C71%240%2410%2C72%240%240%2C1502%240%2440%2C243%240%240%2C1615%240%240%2C919%241%2410&amp;\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">linky</a>)</p><p><img src=\"https://www.metabunk.org/attachments/1792052313174-png.93652/\" alt=\"1792052313174.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"1319\" height=\"839\" />\n\t</p><p>\n\nOverlay in GE.</p><p><img src=\"https://www.metabunk.org/attachments/1792053418455-png.93655/\" alt=\"1792053418455.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"1186\" height=\"761\" />\n\t</p><p>\n\nThat pipline seems to run to this building: (<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Rivi%C3%A8re-au-Renard,+QC+G4X+5K7,+Canada/@48.9943629,-64.3778777,14a,45.5y,57.9h,88.91t/data=!3m10!1e1!3m8!1s1dQnEPHzv_U9VJuKxASM8Q!2e0!6shttps:%2F%2Fstreetviewpixels-pa.clients6.google.com%2Fv1%2Fthumbnail%3Fcb_client%3Dmaps_sv.tactile%26w%3D900%26h%3D600%26pitch%3D1.0947924189854774%26panoid%3D1dQnEPHzv_U9VJuKxASM8Q%26yaw%3D57.899408744442525!7i16384!8i8192!9m2!1b1!2i37!4m7!3m6!1s0x4c9ba489f4a53ad3:0x9f03b402b810e38e!8m2!3d48.992241!4d-64.383984!10e5!16s%2Fm%2F0ch4nfl?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">linky</a>)</p><p><img src=\"https://www.metabunk.org/a